": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_662874483550712_8768404300738813998_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JmFoSM7nwHMQ7kNvwHmXqLK&_nc_oc=AdrLKFrnZ9S2GyXO6JW02G0DEGXQGcHZFiM80UWF6xTomPh4Abi88CzJQ2HdCi1Fo7g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9nsggnvfXcF3ahpTzC86jXRXxYMsYyFs9Qr418Z_0n3g&oe=6A26E9F3"}]}, "id": "1594224948509813", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "4.png", "id": "922885703800841", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_922885707134174_7706247122491600197_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bz6U52Te-tgQ7kNvwF-m1Mu&_nc_oc=Adqs3PJdexR6hdCWo8JURNgulJPsQx2vMHjB58UeV0_nMx77KJrspUZ0SfAatFcGfMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_EVaRBD52RFOyPm7vCI8HvnT5TSmgfaCj1s2BUs4tbAQ&oe=6A26E784"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2356694074755127", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_2356694081421793_4273379312855228259_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x_LmdKQCsaEQ7kNvwEfQ1ui&_nc_oc=Ado0aqyHAb_3yNFHyPR7YCl_BrU5k4OU8Nwotn25nfrVakhQ8BuL0VLzdPEc7LtNf-A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_bE4s0YK0NqdosWoN1n3ipPEyUnEjCnPcR3q6uhj8PJQ&oe=6A26DEC5"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1564800354581143", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1564800357914476_2298972780867235037_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C7oqyf-hzA0Q7kNvwE_lTgy&_nc_oc=AdpOqtNtWc_f7Oxn1BiH6TgFJ8b1sffRBq6TSAgTdUpfpSf4igioXbojUePEoY8sCRY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8mHmjx9GpJZcYD_5zeV6f-IRdYuN9337WI8wFr9vY8Tw&oe=6A26CEA8"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1489169422899592", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1489169426232925_3075778964783573218_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AlPwdcpnwDoQ7kNvwHvhk11&_nc_oc=AdoNeQcBtCsnDyK9XIDMH7kRV0Iv0JlzfMT7-h9MQwkAhHx8RunxbtiOdIVIqGMglCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_XGt3fLyjKGV5xyaseUk3rvrnvHQdlm275efevPo559w&oe=6A26E0EC"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "913550198152625", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_913550201485958_2498617945495418509_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OnPi8UbGXtYQ7kNvwFDsyVF&_nc_oc=Adr480S_pfCJ--OhdPHz3K6oQ-MLHZGGXWWp4l45xSXejCGUnszI3881Dx4pj-5KEsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_j4ZH5rTV-HYEtxVieRelG36H0rZV0Ji2-SJd8QjUlwQ&oe=6A26C019"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Aslon: Tower of Trial", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Awaken in the shadow of the Great Archive, where memory is your last weapon. Guided by Velanthor, the Thought Dragon, you embark on a mystical journey through forgotten truths, fractured identities, and battles of the mind. The Soul Eater \u2013 an ancient entity that consumes meaning and history \u2013 threatens the very fabric of existence.\nExplore a visually rich world where books breathe, thoughts become weapons, and every NPC holds a fragment of lost truth. Your choices shape not only the story, but your own memory. With a unique dialogue system, deep lore, and haunting music, this game offers an emotional descent into light and darkness.\nWill you resist the Soul Eater \u2013 or be forgotten yourself?\nThis experience will continue to evolve with future updates and expanded content.\n", "short_description": "Enter a forgotten world where memory is power.\nJoin Velanthor, the Thought Dragon, on a journey against the Soul Eater \u2013 a being that devours meaning itself.\n\nExplore lost places, fight with mind and will, and discover who you truly are.\n\nA single-player VR experience focused on exploration, combat, and meaningful choice.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "968969575668007", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Aslon: Tower of Trial", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Erwache im Schatten des Gro\u00dfen Archivs, wo Erinnerung deine letzte Waffe ist. Geleitet von Velanthor, dem Gedankendrachen, begibst du dich auf eine mystische Reise durch vergessene Wahrheiten, zerbrochene Identit\u00e4ten und K\u00e4mpfe des Geistes. Der Seelenfresser \u2013 eine uralte Entit\u00e4t, die Bedeutung und Geschichte verschlingt \u2013 bedroht das Gef\u00fcge der Existenz selbst.\n\nErkunde eine visuell dichte Welt, in der B\u00fccher atmen, Gedanken zu Waffen werden und jeder NPC ein Fragment verlorener Wahrheit in sich tr\u00e4gt. Deine Entscheidungen formen nicht nur die Geschichte, sondern auch deine eigene Erinnerung. Mit einem einzigartigen Dialogsystem, tiefgr\u00fcndiger Lore und eindringlicher Musik erwartet dich ein emotionaler Abstieg zwischen Licht und Dunkelheit.\n\nWirst du dem Seelenfresser widerstehen \u2013 oder selbst vergessen werden?\n\nDieses Erlebnis wird sich mit zuk\u00fcnftigen Updates und neuen Inhalten weiterentwickeln.", "short_description": "Betritt eine vergessene Welt, in der Erinnerung Macht bedeutet.\nBegleite Velanthor, den Gedankendrachen, auf einer Reise gegen den Seelenfresser \u2013 ein Wesen, das Bedeutung selbst verschlingt.\n\nErkunde verlorene Orte, k\u00e4mpfe mit Geist und Willen und entdecke, wer du wirklich bist.\n\nEin Einzelspieler-VR-Erlebnis mit Fokus auf Erkundung, Kampf und bedeutungsvollen Entscheidungen."}]}, "developer_name": "SuraFix Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/Deus-Inkubu/23135b4569fab53fa6289651825d051f", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SuraFix Game Studio", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/NWd7M7gHd4", "website_url": "https://surafixstudio.de.cool/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "c