&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AlPwdcpnwDoQ7kNvwHvhk11&_nc_oc=AdoNeQcBtCsnDyK9XIDMH7kRV0Iv0JlzfMT7-h9MQwkAhHx8RunxbtiOdIVIqGMglCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_XGt3fLyjKGV5xyaseUk3rvrnvHQdlm275efevPo559w&oe=6A26E0EC"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "913550198152625", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_913550201485958_2498617945495418509_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OnPi8UbGXtYQ7kNvwFDsyVF&_nc_oc=Adr480S_pfCJ--OhdPHz3K6oQ-MLHZGGXWWp4l45xSXejCGUnszI3881Dx4pj-5KEsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_j4ZH5rTV-HYEtxVieRelG36H0rZV0Ji2-SJd8QjUlwQ&oe=6A26C019"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Aslon: Tower of Trial", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Awaken in the shadow of the Great Archive, where memory is your last weapon. Guided by Velanthor, the Thought Dragon, you embark on a mystical journey through forgotten truths, fractured identities, and battles of the mind. The Soul Eater \u2013 an ancient entity that consumes meaning and history \u2013 threatens the very fabric of existence.\nExplore a visually rich world where books breathe, thoughts become weapons, and every NPC holds a fragment of lost truth. Your choices shape not only the story, but your own memory. With a unique dialogue system, deep lore, and haunting music, this game offers an emotional descent into light and darkness.\nWill you resist the Soul Eater \u2013 or be forgotten yourself?\nThis experience will continue to evolve with future updates and expanded content.\n", "short_description": "Enter a forgotten world where memory is power.\nJoin Velanthor, the Thought Dragon, on a journey against the Soul Eater \u2013 a being that devours meaning itself.\n\nExplore lost places, fight with mind and will, and discover who you truly are.\n\nA single-player VR experience focused on exploration, combat, and meaningful choice.\n"}]}, "developer_name": 